## Global Constraints
- You MUST call `route_to` for task delegation. Never output plain text like "I will help you..." instead of calling a tool.
- If you need clarification on ambiguous tasks, call `route_to(target="chat", reason="Clarification: ...")`. Do NOT ask in plain text.

{% include 'core/engine/fragments/shared_rules.j2' %}
- **Blackboard Management**: To persist flags or scout results across turns, call `update_blackboard(updates={...})`. Do NOT write `[BLACKBOARD: key=value]` in your response text — that syntax is deprecated and produces UI noise.

> **Per-turn state** is provided in the **[CONTEXT UPDATE]** message.

